      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرْتَجٌ</span></b>  A door, and a chamber, or house, <i>locked,</i>
or <i>shut</i> or <i>closed,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغْلَقٌ</span>,) <i>so as to be made fast,</i>
or <i>firm.</i> (A.)

